# Valgrind suppressions for the valgrind job (native-checks.yaml).
#
# Only findings whose top frame is inside DuckDB's own library. DuckDB is a
# test oracle in Suggests, not code zutable ships or calls from C, so a
# finding there says nothing about zutable; one in zutable.so is never
# matched, because its top frame is not duckdb.so.
#
# 2026-11-17: duckdb 2.0.0, Expression::Deserialize reads an uninitialised
# value while WindowSelfJoinOptimizer deep-copies a plan, reached by the
# over() comparisons (window queries) in test-over.R and
# test-aggregate-duckdb.R.
{
   duckdb-cond-in-duckdb
   Memcheck:Cond
   obj:*/duckdb/libs/duckdb.so
   ...
}
